{"id":"ab9eeb02fa679c0c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Gap In Order","display":"df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order — ZFC Order10 Gap In Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order — ZFC Order10 Gap In Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-gaps]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order — ZFC Order10 Gap In Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c1f6f430663d687\" href=\"?note=5c1f6f430663d687\" title=\"58-df-gaps\">58-df-gaps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (ordered set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,U\\subseteq P\">\\(L,U\\subseteq P\\)</span> (lower and upper parts)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10GapInOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10GapInOrder}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}gap\\text{-}in\\text{-}order}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10GapInOrder}_S(L,U,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land L\\neq\\emptyset\\land U\\neq\\emptyset\\land L\\cup U=P\\land L\\cap U=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(y\\leq_Px\\to y\\in L)\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_Py\\to y\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall l\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(l\\leq_Pu)\n\\land\\neg\\exists x\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\forall l\\in L\\;(l\\leq_Px)\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;(x\\leq_Pu)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}gap\\text{-}in\\text{-}order}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10GapInOrder}_S(L,U,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land L\\neq\\emptyset\\land U\\neq\\emptyset\\land L\\cup U=P\\land L\\cap U=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(y\\leq_Px\\to y\\in L)\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_Py\\to y\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall l\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(l\\leq_Pu)\n\\land\\neg\\exists x\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\forall l\\in L\\;(l\\leq_Px)\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;(x\\leq_Pu)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The two sides are required to be a lower set and an upper set; the final clause excludes an interpolating element realizing the cut.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-gaps","status":"resolved","id":"5c1f6f430663d687","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-gaps]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ (ordered set, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P$ (order relation on $P$, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Order}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"L,U\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Order}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10GapInOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}gap\\text{-}in\\text{-}order}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10GapInOrder}_S(L,U,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land L\\neq\\emptyset\\land U\\neq\\emptyset\\land L\\cup U=P\\land L\\cap U=\\emptyset\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(y\\leq_Px\\to y\\in L)\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_Py\\to y\\in U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall l\\in L\\;\\forall u\\in U\\;(l\\leq_Pu)\n\\land\\neg\\exists x\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\forall l\\in L\\;(l\\leq_Px)\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;(x\\leq_Pu)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1365,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2864","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order.md|58-df-zfc-order10-gap-in-order]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5c1f6f430663d687","2aa29158e60b337f"]}